{#
  The contacts tab of a segment or campaign, and the campaign node modals, as the contact list table: same columns, same order
  (Configuration > Contact Settings), same row (checkbox, three-dots menu) as /s/contacts. Core shows cards here (Lead/grid.html.twig).
  The first load of the tab (a GET) comes with the search bar of the contact list (core's list toolbar) over the table, in one panel;
  what the tab does next (search, sorting, paging, the page size: POSTs) only replaces the table, so the bar keeps its place, its text
  and its focus. `container` is the selector of the table's own element (inside the tab's pane); `outer` the tab's pane.
  Variables: toolbar (true on the first load), searchId, searchValue, searchAction, container, outer and the ones of
  contacts_table_body.html.twig.
#}
{% extends '@MauticCore/Default/raw_output.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}
{% if toolbar %}
    <div class="panel panel-default bdr-t-wdh-0 mb-0">
        {{ include('@MauticCore/Helper/list_toolbar.html.twig', {
            'searchId': searchId,
            'searchValue': searchValue,
            'action': searchAction,
            'target': container,
            'tmpl': tmpl,
            'overlayDisabled': true,
        }) }}
        <div id="{{ container|trim('#') }}">
            {{ include('@MauticPatches/Contact/contacts_table_body.html.twig') }}
        </div>
    </div>
{% else %}
    {{ include('@MauticPatches/Contact/contacts_table_body.html.twig') }}
{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
